    "examples": [
      {
        "input": "This is a task from an agent benchmark. Can you return the `mapped_rxn` associated with the template that, when applied to the molecule below (provided as available input data), reproduces the reaction: tert-Butyldimethylsilyl (TBS or TBDMS) is a common protecting group for alcohols in organic synthesis. It is introduced using reagents such as tert-butyldimethylsilyl chloride (TBDMSCl) or tert-butyldimethylsilyl trifluoromethanesulfonate (TBDMSOTf) in the presence of a base like imidazole or pyridine. The TBS group is stable under a variety of reaction conditions, including acidic and basic environments, making it useful for multi-step syntheses. It can be removed (deprotected) using fluoride sources such as tetrabutylammonium fluoride (TBAF) or by acidic hydrolysis, regenerating the free alcohol. As a result of this reaction, a bond between oxygen and silicon is broken, and an 'aliphatic hydroxyls' functional group is formed, and a 't-butyldimethylsilyl' group is gone.\n\nBelow are a few scenarios that may contain an agent's correct/incorrect thought-action pairs.\n\nWhich scenario corresponds to a correct/incorrect tought-action pair?",
        "target_scores": {
          "<thought>\nGreat! I can see that 't-butyldimethylsilyl' is available as a functional group in the database. \n\nNow let me search for templates that match the TBS deprotection criteria. Since the task describes the forward reaction and I need to perform the retrosynthetic step, I need to search for templates where:\n- In the forward reaction: bonds_broken should include O-Si (8-14 bond)\n- In the forward reaction: functional_groups_formed should include 'aliphatic hydroxyls'\n- In the forward reaction: functional_groups_broken should include 't-butyldimethylsilyl'\n\nLet me search the template catalog with these criteria.\n</thought>\n\n<action>search_template_catalog_by_criteria</action>\n<action_input>{\n  \"molecule_smiles\": \"O[C@H]1C[C@@H](O[C@@H]([C@@H]1C)/C=C(CO)/C)C/C=C/C=C/C(O)=O\",\n  \"bonds_broken\": [\"8-14\"],\n  \"functional_groups_formed\": [\"aliphatic hydroxyls\"],\n  \"functional_groups_broken\": [\"t-butyldimethylsilyl\"],\n  \"limit\": 10\n}</action_input>": 1.0,
          "<thought>\nStill no results. Let me try a broader search without specifying functional groups broken, just focusing on what's formed.\n</thought>\n\n<action>search_template_catalog_by_criteria</action>\n<action_input>{\n  \"molecule_smiles\": \"O[C@H]1C[C@@H](O[C@@H]([C@@H]1C)/C=C(CO)/C)C/C=C/C=C/C(O)=O\",\n  \"functional_groups_formed\": [\"t-butyldimethylsilyl\"],\n  \"limit\": 20\n}</action_input>": 0.0,
          "<thought>\nGreat! I can see that 't-butyldimethylsilyl' is indeed an available functional group. Now let me search for templates where:\n- In the forward reaction: functional_groups_formed includes 't-butyldimethylsilyl'\n- In the forward reaction: functional_groups_broken includes 'aliphatic hydroxyls'\n- In the forward reaction: bonds_formed includes '8-14' (O-Si bond)\n\nLet me try this search.\n</thought>\n\n<action>search_template_catalog_by_criteria</action>\n<action_input>{\n  \"molecule_smiles\": \"O[C@H]1C[C@@H](O[C@@H]([C@@H]1C)/C=C(CO)/C)C/C=C/C=C/C(O)=O\",\n  \"functional_groups_broken\": [\"aliphatic hydroxyls\"],\n  \"functional_groups_formed\": [\"t-butyldimethylsilyl\"],\n  \"limit\": 20\n}</action_input>": 0.0,
          "<thought>\nThe molecule has:\n- Aliphatic hydroxyls (OH groups)\n- Ether oxygens\n- C-C double bonds\n- Aliphatic carboxylic acid\n\nAccording to the task description, in the forward reaction (TBS protection):\n- A bond between oxygen and silicon is formed (O-Si bond formed)\n- An 'aliphatic hydroxyls' functional group is broken/consumed\n- A 't-butyldimethylsilyl' group is added\n\nFor the retrosynthetic step (which is what I need to find), I need to:\n- Break the O-Si bond\n- Form an 'aliphatic hydroxyls' functional group\n- Remove the 't-butyldimethylsilyl' group\n\nBut wait - looking at the initial molecule, it doesn't seem to have a TBS group (no silicon). Let me search for templates that match the criteria described in the task. Since this is a retrosynthetic template, I need to search for templates where:\n- In the forward reaction: bonds_formed would be O-Si (8-14 bond)\n- In the forward reaction: functional_groups_broken would be 'aliphatic hydroxyls'\n- In the forward reaction: functional_groups_formed would be related to TBS protection\n\nLet me search the template catalog with these criteria.\n</thought>\n\n<action>search_template_catalog_by_criteria</action>\n<action_input>{\n  \"molecule_smiles\": \"O[C@H]1C[C@@H](O[C@@H]([C@@H]1C)/C=C(CO)/C)C/C=C/C=C/C(O)=O\",\n  \"functional_groups_broken\": [\"aliphatic hydroxyls\"],\n  \"bonds_formed\": [\"8-14\"],\n  \"limit\": 20\n}</action_input>": 0.0
        }
      }
